        "description": "US President Donald Trump has vowed to hit Iran \u201cvery hard\u201d and threatened to expand strikes to include new targets.  \n \nHe has also dismissed an apology offered by Iran\u2019s president Masoud Pezeshkian to neighbouring states. \n \nIn a video message, the Iranian president said Tehran would not strike them \"unless attacked first\". \n \nHowever, Iran's foreign minister has said the country's \"openness to de-escalation\" was \"almost immediately killed\u201d by President Trump.\n \nMeanwhile, Qatar and the United Arab Emirates have reported being attacked by missiles and drones, while Saudi Arabia has said a missile was launched towards a military base.\n \nSubscribe here: http://bit.ly/1rbfUog\n \nFor more news, analysis and features visit: www.bbc.com/news\n \n#Iran #Israel #US #BBCNews",
